[4792]="7003CD50\n1\tTalk to Aragorn and learn about Epic Battles\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n2\tListen to Aragorn and his companions discuss the coming battle\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n3\tTalk to the Officer and learn about Commanders\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n4\tTalk to Legolas and learn about Approaching Enemies\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n5\tListen to Legolas and his companions discuss the effectiveness of dealing with enemies at range\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n6\tTalk to the Engineer and learn about Siege Equipment\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n7\tTalk to Aragorn and learn about Battle Roles\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n8\tTalk to the Engineer and learn about the Engineer Role\030Talk to the Officer and learn about the Officer Role\030Talk to the Vanguard and learn about the Vanguard Role\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n9\tTalk to Aragorn and learn about Merit\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n10\tListen to Aragorn and his companions discuss Merit and medals\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n11\tTalk to Gimli when you are done learning about Epic Battles for now\tAragorn stands before the walls of the Hornburg, discussing what your friends should expect in the coming battles.\n",
